Cell["\<\
A 3-array has no flat picture of its own, so it is drawn as a row of \
matrices, the first index choosing the matrix:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"cc5b3558-ae4e-0045-9cb8-42d116c39a5b"],

Cell["ArrayGraphics[Array[#1 + #2 + #3 &, {2, 2, 2}]]", "Input",ExpressionUUID->"245d742a-0057-be40-8c94-cfb63b3fb0f8"],

